{"updated":"2026-09-29T00:44:01.319Z","text":"Good evening, sir. Over the last twenty-four hours, the story leading the world is this: US prosecutors reopen case of alleged gang rape at Cornell University. Elsewhere, africa’s space ambitions are moving from policy to practice. And australia news live: Greens to choose new leader next week after Waters steps down; bogong moths back at parliament. All of which keeps the conflict picture centred on US, at active conflict levels, though Iran, and Ukraine are worth keeping an eye on as well. The markets, for their part, felt the weight of it — the S&P 500 down 0.4 percent, the Dow Jones Industrial down 3.9 percent, and the Nasdaq Composite up 1.6 percent. The earth itself has been busier, with 50 tremors above magnitude two and a half — the strongest a 5.4 near north of Svalbard. And overhead, space weather is calm — nothing of concern. That is the shape of the day, sir. The board is yours.","times":[0,0.12,0.17,0.22,0.26,0.31,0.37,0.42,0.46,0.51,0.56,0.59,0.61,0.65,0.67,0.72,0.85,0.94,1.11,1.39,1.51,1.56,1.59,1.61,1.66,1.68,1.71,1.73,1.78,1.82,1.89,1.95,2,2.03,2.07,2.11,2.15,2.18,2.24,2.29,2.33,2.37,2.43,2.47,2.52,2.58,2.63,2.71,2.77,2.84,2.96,3.05,3.17,3.2,3.24,3.27,3.33,3.38,3.44,3.55,3.65,3.7,3.79,3.83,3.89,3.94,3.98,4.04,4.06,4.09,4.13,4.16,4.18,4.2,4.26,4.31,4.42,4.48,4.55,4.63,4.69,4.81,4.84,4.9,4.92,4.99,5.11,5.26,5.43,6.04,6.25,6.4,6.47,6.51,6.56,6.62,6.68,6.75,6.82,6.9,6.97,7.02,7.07,7.15,7.33,7.44,7.54,7.63,7.7,7.77,7.81,7.89,7.96,8.12,8.19,8.34,8.43,8.51,8.54,8.6,8.64,8.68,8.72,8.8,8.86,8.94,8.96,9.02,9.08,9.2,9.24,9.29,9.36,9.42,9.5,9.55,9.63,9.66,9.74,9.78,9.83,9.88,9.95,10.02,10.07,10.14,10.16,10.19,10.29,10.35,10.41,10.46,10.51,10.56,10.62,10.69,10.77,10.84,10.99,11.15,11.59,11.7,11.77,11.83,11.88,11.91,11.97,12.02,12.07,12.19,12.25,12.38,12.49,12.55,12.61,12.65,12.7,12.77,12.81,12.83,12.86,12.92,13,13.09,13.14,13.19,13.22,13.26,13.33,13.39,13.46,13.51,13.56,13.6,13.65,13.71,13.77,13.8,13.83,13.85,13.89,1